{"data": [{"author_id": "281321539", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:27:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113502553598288360"], "id": "2113502553598288360", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The ASEAN Power Grid requires a transition from physical infrastructure development to unified regional regulatory coordination. Enhanced regional grid interconnection could enable renewable energy to supply over 70% of ASEAN's power mix by 2050.\nhttps://t.co/WF2Yvmc0Dl\n#SIEW2026", "url": "https://x.com/ESI_EnergyVibes/status/2113502553598288360"}, {"author_id": "2111749446015082496", "created_at": "2026-10-24T16:54:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114037755231735824"], "id": "2114037755231735824", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The AI trade is transitioning from an equity story to a credit reality.\n\nWith corporate bond spreads widening and $1.4T in off-balance-sheet SPV debt floating, the 7-year lead time for high-voltage grid interconnection is no longer just a delay. It is a default trigger.", "url": "https://x.com/itinearyvision/status/2114037755231735824"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-24T12:05:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113965138931806234"], "id": "2113965138931806234", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Gartner: data center power up 26% this year, to 565 TWh. AI servers overtake conventional in power draw by 2027. Grid interconnection takes 3-7 years. The data centers built on schedule aren't waiting in that queue. Are utilities actually keeping up?", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2113965138931806234"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-23T14:06:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113633181249282342"], "id": "2113633181249282342", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Most companies rent power. The winners own it. Grid interconnection takes 3-7 years in most US markets. Data centers build in 18 months. The developers building off-grid generation and battery storage aren't being clever. They're just the only ones on the right timeline.", "url": "https://x.com/grantbmcdaniel/status/2113633181249282342"}, {"author_id": "813034080044392448", "created_at": "2026-10-24T09:00:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113918419599048728"], "id": "2113918419599048728", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 370, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 3}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113771052987772997", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Andy Jassy saying AWS capacity is sold out through 2027 is less about a temporary shortage and more about lead times.\n\nNew power generation and grid interconnection still take years.\n\nOnce the large buyers have locked the available megawatts, everyone else is competing for https://t.co/BiMVN77n4h", "url": "https://x.com/shawnchauhan1/status/2113918419599048728"}, {"author_id": "1603256714731610113", "created_at": "2026-10-24T17:44:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114050427754783144"], "id": "2114050427754783144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Read \"Sodium-ion batteries without active cooling aim to cut grid storage costs by 20%\" on SmartNews: https://t.co/TfN0JuD4VE #SmartNews", "url": "https://x.com/pio007max/status/2114050427754783144"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2105720795343241216"]}, "author_id": "1453471240228786179", "created_at": "2026-10-23T19:05:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113708285652320500"], "id": "2113708285652320500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A battery cell doesn't become commercial-ready overnight.\n\nOne of our biggest milestones was scaling our sodium-ion cell from 18 Ah to 70 Ah. 🔋\n\nThat's nearly 4× the capacity.\n\nWhy does that matter?\n\nBecause scaling a technology isn't just about making it work.\nIt's about making https://t.co/ZKmbNPUme8", "url": "https://x.com/nextthingtech/status/2113708285652320500"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2102328338463518720"]}, "author_id": "1133651678694035456", "created_at": "2026-10-24T00:25:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113788814762377614"], "id": "2113788814762377614", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 175, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Hithium Energy Storage has unveiled its next-generation sodium-ion integrated solution, marking a step in transitioning sodium technology from technical validation to large-scale deployment. Powered by high-capacity sodium-ion batteries, the system is slated for full-chain mass https://t.co/RE7gpjfyVg", "url": "https://x.com/sinoprise/status/2113788814762377614"}, {"author_id": "180283593", "created_at": "2026-10-24T03:05:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113829235702092164"], "id": "2113829235702092164", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sodium-Ion Batteries Are Here: CATL Naxtra Explained (No Lithium!) https://t.co/8eeLMEvmTt via @YouTube", "url": "https://x.com/Niranjanhc/status/2113829235702092164"}, {"author_id": "1611906439521484801", "created_at": "2026-10-23T22:34:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113760953112400241"], "id": "2113760953112400241", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "l